{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb008a1473ea1eebb2d951c8c77d0e64e7ad9fcef9ef835d5291771c83c91bf",
      "text": "伫立在前方的背影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134d480b7302884442f872788cce283c5201af0b576bb73e51b60750b3f46cd7",
      "text": "冬马得知熟识的乐队乐手受到其他乐队施压，\n原本作为据点活动的Livehouse被抢占了。\n在这当中，Jupiter定下了出演摇滚音乐节的日程……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb008a1473ea1eebb2d951c8c77d0e64e7ad9fcef9ef835d5291771c83c91bf",
      "text": "伫立在前方的背影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7436562ac12174da4621114652fc84aee97f59eee0e9e4a7eb344c5c41083853",
      "text": "……这里可是摇滚的盛典。就凭你们这种\n不温不火的小偶像能干得了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc304726dc61c71d0c105ec72aa1b62d539317dde01782e2cb8d31552ba4e1bc",
      "text": "趁着还没丢脸赶紧滚回家去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eaf443ac38c938fa1562a64a7da6e1a3999c7bac008ce58abba2d9cb48b216e",
      "text": "我们可不是来玩的。\n是为了打倒你们才来到这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea099d1cae4bff0a4540a468dd843d40932b28d59964032635d072fa7d54880f",
      "text": "听好了，给我约好了。如果我们赢了……\n就把那个Livehouse还回来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33a06698d63eb48aed54dc267a3d2485c5b5a3173da12d023e1ada4ddbe47295",
      "text": "哈，口气倒挺大的嘛。\n办得到的话你们就试试看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b7c6b897e0b16dd771a6546682c0fc4d9cf63fa355a72b3a6352a1170b68e20",
      "text": "那位就是大家谈到的那个乐队的……\n这下可绝对不能输呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef58730a679bd4ae89c8359517eb8b22f075dccee144732a2bf82a4a0171a90",
      "text": "就算是在客场也无所谓。\n我们会让全场气氛燃到最顶点的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6949a7ec5feb9390bf2aa1188877eb5921e4af317825c3450d92274f25de56c0",
      "text": "被说到这个份上，总不能笑嘻嘻地\n点头认了吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:474eeb17c573f5e2b92028b6f5d0b363131aa216acf94ab319984632ccc58859",
      "text": "是啊。就把全场的观众，\n全都变成我们的俘虏吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c8b196fb009601563c295a88d0a3aff2457f33dd201b8c7820d44c26f4b1cc",
      "text": "噢！让他们见识一下Jupiter的力量吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14bbbe674a71de5bebd9fffbe6e661eaa2576f1fb8ead6c633533c685eeb8e86",
      "text": "咦，莫非是冬马君？那边的\n是北斗君和翔太君吧。好久不见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a355c1b7371dc035edbbdbba244b969c251f1b02a2c704ac84154ab183a1a344",
      "text": "好久不见！上次见面，\n还是我们在961 Production的时候吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b864edd1a823b8992cc49e2d638a90b83c21b3166afaa0d81940cc622f808b",
      "text": "已经过去那么久了吗。真怀念啊。\n冬马君你们还在继续当偶像，我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f37e637f09366b2d067f97f405c5a849e6ab25d5f799a86e97282952fc6b892c",
      "text": "谢谢。你们那边最近怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3caf33dd3295ca3d68100b8034bd476fe755a4f1df932a54c14f88004673f707",
      "text": "其实……最近，受到了属于大型唱片公司的乐队\n施加的压力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eef2c314e0bd0fd63ba7174e9362025c601ff2081502fae1bb89f50612fd11be",
      "text": "我们乐队一直作为据点活动的\nLivehouse用不了了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bfad9323030fd096ae859b4e2c21446ae28c3328a68a90788574722ab18e614",
      "text": "搞什么啊那是……你们乐队做的曲子，\n明明全都是超级棒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339610c10968fb9f84271a121a4807e41bac80abf05fe8f4bf54a14b3390f75d",
      "text": "演奏也棒到让人热血沸腾。\n妨碍别人什么的绝不可原谅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f70a14408d12280c9540b6beaa438f058dc44a06dbfbeb115cc776857880fa8",
      "text": "冬马君，我懂你的心情，\n但别在走廊里这么激动嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48244171917f61f6ba4141621d8b1aecb7bb671942f1a7e5efab3ded7ea117b7",
      "text": "我也听过那样的传闻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5e766a40c7bf63c98952150704a56c12f3458c193d93bc4a1511539b692572f",
      "text": "前阵子见到的天使酱刚好是你们的粉丝，\n因为去不了演出而感到很遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c254f00780af460238cc7743b83fefa866b194088172834eab466ec66df5a5",
      "text": "这样啊……果然还是让粉丝们\n伤心了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3041916f2d3c6e99d23cbb76ce94143112a6e07215484a3d0d4ae49efaeb7e",
      "text": "希望你们不要输给那些家伙。如果我们有\n能帮上忙的地方，请尽管说！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0c9653aa5e36684b9aac834ac778933538a66c30e713140d3c3d26f3075c676",
      "text": "这次给Jupiter送来的邀约，\n是每年夏季举办的摇滚音乐节！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4757fc25c1e3db9be2a22a96585ee7beeec2a9aba8d01f07b52320cc1a7cbf8d",
      "text": "诶，那个摇滚音乐节，是有很多实力派乐队\n出场的那个吧？太厉害了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4778bb1b8726879a324f4ecc46c5c857623b0c1e4742581743dfbf696869f695",
      "text": "没想到居然会找上身为偶像的我们……\n真是不胜荣幸呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d76716cf453d3d2a8d3cd18a522786ff6a0c069c560455ff09b87c790cb742",
      "text": "是啊！说明他们十分看好我们。\n必须让他们见识见识我们是有实力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758722f7eb4f1fad140f3f7ac74eff2a3bb6b3730a297788f7f391eebc063adc",
      "text": "好的！\n然后这是演出名单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfb3ff1f069e99b6ecd228dd6d152075918757c93be32261d100e11fea97a2f2",
      "text": "……咦？冬马，这不就是前阵子\n聊到的那个乐队吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c01f7ce6e4758a8a6c1927474237cb3f1673a7915af85a02b9a1aca3477e26b",
      "text": "真的耶……\n那些家伙也会出演吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9910fba7f1c5c1c6e3e16e650fba7075a6d7c80de347772e7fb6885fc29ee31b",
      "text": "是最近正当红的乐队呢。\n我也听说过名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c06a8978a03a5ed49d62909cb2378036d562efa61c5eaa3b8deab177ecfae499",
      "text": "发生了什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea630243b166db9ed9d794104a64988fe5a5e0664bc508ecc10da5919fe66b9e",
      "text": "其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cb1ba858134cf210615fe77aa2406d1791f38cdba5cd6bafd24e0209a19d6c",
      "text": "……原来如此，\n是这么回事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5145951ca65e297a1ae69f7c1f4ae5095d8109ba21b20520851b5ebd07e34eae",
      "text": "感觉有点像黑酱的作风呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe",
      "text": "唔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:888f5df851c409db624015e9b932dcd1effe12ef258542964c06960e49d355f9",
      "text": "践踏为了传递真正的好音乐\n而努力的人们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66edef3b1fac68afe3c4680b446ec4f8d15d1eb3204b5c81054631de8a4c6fe3",
      "text": "像某些人一样用卑劣手段的家伙，绝对不可原谅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b81f7348decb62c9a7121e70feb3b4b2d0a6237bfb0a5d55f1587d2cacef13b",
      "text": "真是的，一下子就激动起来了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e76e018375eea906074fd0b0ea531754027d6ed397f89193aedd50f8ea5c31c1",
      "text": "不过那不正是冬马的风格嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec5da8a78f7bb09a6806de26a4b5d338365c74aef72a164d93a2dbbc5cc07e0f",
      "text": "啊哈哈，确实可能是呢。\n不激动的冬马君简直难以想象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b40136070ce2af7f85ae4aebb237811f0e4562f75d149cf5a858613ad3eafd",
      "text": "翔太、北斗，你们在那窃窃私语什么呢。\n这次的音乐节，一定要大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d9356a60366601d87a6f498d8a22c3d9fbdec05026b74b070f97d28be107c92",
      "text": "大家一起努力吧！\n马上来调整练习日程吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6abd338365caf2354127b1cc55c628c3eb3cc878f481e50e39dc10ca2b49d46",
      "text": "按照冬马先生的期望，我们已经拜托认识的乐队\n来担任Jupiter的现场伴奏乐队了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5bd6ca7715ee7c45aee221d1c5544c19e2fb12fc686d47e725810890fd3d7a0",
      "text": "对方很痛快地接受了邀约！\n大家都非常有干劲哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a556e813fba1c95f85f291b64c6a30438a43ecf5314f9d8cb2dc9a3c932210b3",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31757e04683765c172d4c7dc5c1bc0c85f724a5a69649e820f96204c636e525",
      "text": "按照日程来看，跟乐队成员\n合排的机会没那么多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bba1bac74d622e1c1cad9471148f72a21f123c936e3abe4d1a4a98d28645fb",
      "text": "在联合练习之前，把表演水平提升上去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1750c5772367a8dc6f688812d57bb35cc4ca10d5e36965d350fba4e231a6d3",
      "text": "对我们偶像来说摇滚音乐节正是客场，\n所以才更要比平时更燃起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495e6f579090343d20fd978f33f828caec95d4c94580fe32d9c58d2e23665e40",
      "text": "冬马，太急于求成的话，\n能看见的东西也会变得看不见的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614553aa126d187c8689b274dbcc30131da3c4a23f8a7b61d3f89fa8aa3d831e",
      "text": "就是就是，稍微冷静一点嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f4c870aaf213f9966b292371d4e501774bac1f70ebafa865b94d229c5c9b64",
      "text": "搞什么嘛……\n你们不也干劲十足吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96663f9105bad8f4394a628f93d10ea2f3d12d4f5736c197f5711712f5831dda",
      "text": "是啊，虽然观众里的女性可能比平时少，\n但必须展现出帅气的一面才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd85f7c1fb6bdad4b306330b18b74e1204a7bbefe51a73ad9e7f2ba850fb0495",
      "text": "还是老样子呢，北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000111:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f363777c1db9769f6910228b817b35c1769fd524489d55d53e8dbaf1b1cc28",
      "text": "找朋友借来了\n乐队的演出DVD",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d7de33ffef321d0d76da080156a096be2efeb4e285b3422bcd8ffabd69d60a",
      "text": "大家一起看，\n当做音乐节的参考吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ee25ef05a5cfc389503090cf87de3b7adad1802d9006c528f2ef61c9beea78c",
      "text": "当然没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000130:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000130:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04f476becff7df99265a406b881b473c6507a0723d06d74ce94f3d9500d10778",
      "text": "我知道了！\n明天练习之前\n一起看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad8de0955bd39b03755233fda396ee5ad98138ca2afd2e7cc8eee326c50a610",
      "text": "诶——？\n怎么办好呢～<emoji>image_talk_emoji_08</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000135:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241b93b7f7a7d650ed94f559742f46c622fcb77d02b364a2c6f77c97e3b6d688",
      "text": "搞什么，你不想看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000137:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ecdb2f77ea79a27dda653295e973f2440d7d1583f42ed84aeb211da35cea57b",
      "text": "要是有冬马君的便当的话～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38a49f2c6923dacdb23d008a8f9c0670074e990746c30a4a5064317cb328d9b",
      "text": "要是有装满了好多我爱吃的菜\n的便当，说不定\n就涌出干劲了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:369e7c46eb18b42cea8072615fb59d41680fd474a2d45f1738eeaf190323451e",
      "text": "你小子，\n纯粹就是想说这个吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed37718b86a56cd11c0bfcc81e0c7673f2eb7e56457ab4bb656fb5c2cf0e530e",
      "text": "知道了啦，相对的\n你要陪我去买菜啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71eeea73a454c387c533a6b243a6eae747039070f4011f7afc1fe666a4d8731e",
      "text": "北斗和制作人的份\n我也一起做了吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000148:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2748f98b581d6a0e55e73e8a9f986d33f92b9547a36b5f0595cb7904318639b3",
      "text": "很期待哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000148:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652d8dce3f4ebde0adf49521741688aac1095f6f17669492df647273843212b4",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n我很期待便当哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000149:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:319a0fff36001f44195970b32883cf68a22daf87049b2fed695cbfb18b73935f",
      "text": "我来帮忙采购",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000149:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad1f1a9746f2cd056de31cbf98050ad8343597f6a5a77d20cc7217347bd85ffc",
      "text": "那样的话，\n我也来帮忙采购吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000152:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000157:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e235996eef028b5bfcb0815d96ab9f21dd8589c2c114d62f20847d38788ace",
      "text": "我让北斗和翔太帮忙就行，\n制作人等着就好",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000159:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af006d8c77ef944f72febb5dd9f117675886cb87ceb4fe23b5f51151e647b9f8",
      "text": "那就敬请期待明天的\n成果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618774915e926160349e7aa2bafc58deec43850d17b3cce6fd95f1da26beec03",
      "text": "呐呐，冬马君。我想吃炸鸡块～\n还有甜甜的厚蛋烧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90bf6038ea5d58f732f5021cc0d8c8e0bf4de59959bb49f4eb575780a49c525b",
      "text": "真是的，我这边可是连营养均衡都在考虑的啊。\n北斗有没有什么想吃的东西？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:588cb72a8cffdfc459957f4f489e02ee309d76e5ff5e3a7d808c84f73a7992e6",
      "text": "我都可以哦。只要是冬马做的，\n什么都很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b5702cc03f64526bf54c6aedd61653af04116f91b133eab1ed74a611def6a7e",
      "text": "那就是这么回事啦，\n接下来生姜烧肉也拜托了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf2fb915059b998ddf3c5f42434adfe4a7cd7601aa7fcce7e0a5ed6c41b63a62",
      "text": "知道了知道了。\n相对的，收拾得帮忙啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9686280e463d8ad321615c99af2d6fcee299d49f00049cd11fb3c2ad1cdc6801",
      "text": "多谢款待。\n冬马君的便当好好吃～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0df3950a8422373b8639ff2b31085f424b5942eb5aa251767b75b1b2d89029ae",
      "text": "那还真是谢谢夸奖了。\n话说，你到底有没有在好好看DVD啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:621524c184083bc6f2fcc703df1474a0d61efef011ae50e700ae607eec34e3eb",
      "text": "我在看啦。不过嘛，只要我拿出真本事，\n还可以让气氛更热烈得多呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e322d0a0a2c52301109bcc8a0ddbdf1bd51cdf087612554adbb93575dfa652d",
      "text": "呵呵，翔太说得对。\n我们的话一定能做到的，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93a199d789ad6fbdf105c1f9570b1a4d58bf3549442ee7ce4fce8e68c10109c7",
      "text": "虽然话是这么说啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf75092e717c44c2d253a0e70842da883a56312f47e9082e32a441747f01f18",
      "text": "所以说，●●●●プロデューサー。\n等会儿想和你商量一下方案。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9a026345f37228822c4fe302f5e2ce4b717b6750304d10276c387559d0b4202",
      "text": "好的。\n我们聊聊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000178:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b68ec6911add63112d8db76483345adf7973b305f67dbf177591dc8fcc186be2",
      "text": "嗨，●●●●プロデューサー！\n今天也辛苦啦。练习挺高强度的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000194:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f6759f6df3a947647435a9eba512277cd188ab30c281f6ea1d05b6fa0888134",
      "text": "说起来今天冬马君的便当，\n真的很好吃呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ed8f978e04ccaf3397d665620403747418aad6d0371925f687ca329ff80873",
      "text": "冬马君做的菜一直都很好吃，\n最近水平又提高了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:895e7fd2b6a309005a85b017799d84538e5d58e062d41237d7decc527aecdec4",
      "text": "下次再让他做点别的吧。\n下次点什么菜好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000202:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3785fa040d764138bc7f706489a9bc71e18c6ab34d7c431fa40f7e101ef79015",
      "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー觉得\n什么比较好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000204:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46b216f786d0d40b0cd3c40e771b2e68a961819bdb933095b51cfd3169a840d5",
      "text": "翔太先生喜欢吃的东西",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000205:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e15c5f304bec8fd277e41e1791c2348252d997b2b1a78bcbbace25765fa2f4d",
      "text": "冬马先生的特制咖喱",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000208:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05e073d5219e55f91f84efb2f1f889ba2fe3dd9bf855ead598295f66adb6ded8",
      "text": "果然还是最喜欢吃的东西最棒呢。\n必须让他做炸鸡块和甜甜的厚蛋烧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000213:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5b88740d54c47588601aae042c172e97762f539adbaf5770ada6ecd2da7848c",
      "text": "冬马君的咖喱超级好吃的呢。\n好，就定特制咖喱便当吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000217:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d93a222913a638e78546bc5d4578b99385f74caa6e386a791c2e099f01f6cca3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー要是有想吃的东西\n也一起点单吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62fafbffc3625f23a690ef89db38d5843bd3064358a65b1925e19c20df5b78a8",
      "text": "冬马君人很温柔，\n什么菜都会做给我们的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_f:cmd-000221:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b222100a52ce84b57e05e8a64445a9710cd92426b2d8e8e59ca6baad612564e0",
      "text": "……啊，姐姐叫我了。\n那就下次再聊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e43a943c22cca4c6b83d79c816fae6499da4792e011c96d7c5ac7cc9434660b",
      "text": "冬马君，刚才的表现非常棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80ad3f499ce1cdb78745106b5b9aad06973db3eaf0f678241559c9dcbf5015d",
      "text": "谢谢！\n这都多亏了您给的建议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822936d3bfccf4506fd97de2a7a0a3340ec463f325e7e912172e24a2b689df6b",
      "text": "对了，我有一点想要确认的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:662349faf99dcc6a66ff99ca04792f1f521a6535a264a7738a116caba4af4fe3",
      "text": "呐，北斗君。冬马君很热血是\n一如既往啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc421ef4ab5844176160daf2d39a5814416034bad66ce4cbb56b8e2a9bd47b81",
      "text": "北斗君也挺起劲的嘛？\n又是提出各种练习方案的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0941b2df909d48486661805ffa8ac27cac27f57454c8f7ee56aece75fccc82b",
      "text": "明明之前还说过女孩子好像不太多的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:940d1578028ce0e2d19fc3d2d3b3770062bdc59a847fd5f5b21f5a5ed5bea80f",
      "text": "难得冬马那么拼命，\n我怎么能偷懒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c3737b045342c2e77aa5e142b16a204937df661753dfb6dd42f6de5e560bcd",
      "text": "而且……过程很开心也很有趣啊。\n总觉得重新找回了热情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31fdf64bf9bce15d89714a9318358b85ce20497cd7df11bca153406bf01ce429",
      "text": "哼～？不过，我也差不多吧。\n总觉得被带动起来了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a0fcb6608f3c0017c9f98a9349d69f25969168d89ab2b9d4de016ad1e16858a",
      "text": "只是比起黑酱那时候，伙食稍微\n寒酸了点就是啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d9dbd15c49dc9ea3a896dc43319dacbcd17a4acecf992f52c2375e736dc92e4",
      "text": "嘛，反正冬马君的便当很好吃，倒也无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3edd8b50eb75b55f4e2e82b9f015fdc2d65eed3572ff6a9fa0dd0330ab2d3883",
      "text": "呵呵，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:180c3b1bc7e97837ef1d441cb0494c392a8188c9d442872ae1aaea2e4283bbb2",
      "text": "喂——，北斗、翔太。\n稍微过来一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_g:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7b9ffe1b033510fe013fe3001d04c222bba0de4e98b5481dc1b63664a4ebc4c",
      "text": "摇滚音乐节当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3391f2ee43b87dcaf61f73bab46c903b2ae86d2ab3f355ec14ecb220e725f0ef",
      "text": "哎呀，离音乐节开始还有挺长时间呢，\n翔太居然没在打瞌睡，真罕见啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b172a2cacaede45351c0e6839e67d4cc6afea6b261e15c548186c02d7d54e742",
      "text": "那当然啦！\n今天的我可不一样哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d3638e0a6ca119db6327e7b3c7d49d7da505c19cabd1c5a96b1f65bf9cb11c",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，别整个人趴在桌子上啊！\n真是的，到底有没有紧张感啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9373bc3274139f1da729d1bd6eb5873df0127012685574f0d446ea5afdc3e68c",
      "text": "讨厌啦，冬马君。\n开个玩笑而已嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8905beb45540a7906bd28f857351320d82f8fab35ecfb5f0f3ec1c52e6e9d5e",
      "text": "哟，Jupiter的各位。\n今天请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:905d1011723e530b563b07fe82bf93bac8f7ce62db2ccb9e77aeea5e5de8f7c9",
      "text": "我们才要请您多多关照。\n一起轰轰烈烈地大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bee6b6b4c57467d61f96dc1643d0ddd2506292de680f13b93cd7f00b1e8d4175",
      "text": "说什么大干一场啊。\n净会说大话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e3836b743c20cc6cacf5a5d234120eaeb926e9ca18cbb3bfe44f4294bd3a2",
      "text": "！你这家伙是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7436562ac12174da4621114652fc84aee97f59eee0e9e4a7eb344c5c41083853",
      "text": "……这里可是摇滚的盛典。就凭你们这种\n不温不火的小偶像能干得了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc304726dc61c71d0c105ec72aa1b62d539317dde01782e2cb8d31552ba4e1bc",
      "text": "趁着还没丢脸赶紧滚回家去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eaf443ac38c938fa1562a64a7da6e1a3999c7bac008ce58abba2d9cb48b216e",
      "text": "我们可不是来玩的。\n是为了打倒你们才来到这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea099d1cae4bff0a4540a468dd843d40932b28d59964032635d072fa7d54880f",
      "text": "听好了，给我约好了。如果我们赢了……\n就把那个Livehouse还回来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33a06698d63eb48aed54dc267a3d2485c5b5a3173da12d023e1ada4ddbe47295",
      "text": "哈，口气倒挺大的嘛。\n办得到的话你们就试试看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68fe846c711d147a0d966e3f4f6a685702dc8e157d2086e5092cde1f938f7882",
      "text": "接下来好像轮到那些家伙出场了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd272d48c343da737c5a7354c92b51aa819f0b657019b28ebf40a080eeff763",
      "text": "……嘿，压倒性的表演呢。\n实力确实相当扎实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15fc8cee4ee11ca75cc2d00a80ec89a6300b424b8b040eaccd30a5a38b214a31",
      "text": "观众的气氛也是目前为止的乐队里\n最热烈的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb1ea893e40bcb6217e297a66483108eaacf166d2a9208fcb0766dbff5389ff4",
      "text": "说明不只是嘴上功夫啊。\n这样才有打倒的价值！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a8ad9ae4d9217f02cb4bb0587eb206bb7e7b9091233b35c4266422dac03f202",
      "text": "Jupiter的各位，请准备候场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fba3df90df05410a9efeb610d187d6cc3bb0dec5489f614154cca4b99cefc7b",
      "text": "好嘞！大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000091:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86b9e8163f0a7f1799efe4fc0bc9d07918211984fffd357330c6947ed4c0f70d",
      "text": "摇滚音乐节舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8742810eeb7997c33c28bde69cd97d2bd356f176d476468c9458ee0a302058",
      "text": "接下来是……Jupiter？\n哼，偶像来摇滚音乐节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94fc74c61a7818499582e82eb6f4cbd2c2048840e3cbe1807176f7882e473888",
      "text": "（果然是这种反应呢。\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6439bffe8fc29e3c84196e21dd5b3e9dd3639edfe0efd14ba633dab47a589e42",
      "text": "大家好，我们是Jupiter！来看看我们的……\n来看看偶像的表演吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:481fde3145068f84aadc488e7ff4b46f3603fe4f18ff7ca5ff073e3ab650b2df",
      "text": "（虽然大部分人对我们不感兴趣，\n但这样反而更燃了呢♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f9340e225ec3b09b09f189288e460f1224cf51ade4f220714a750c553ade1a",
      "text": "（用我们的表演，\n让全场的观众为之倾倒吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bc09cbf4e189ef14a0cddeb006fdb278140300748710e9192412c42773802c",
      "text": "嘿，原来偶像这么帅气啊。\n唱歌跳舞都很厉害，挺有两把刷子嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4af5c76d70874086e7c4432f1d0fc71c673683513f1c67192cf7070441dfaea",
      "text": "喂喂，怎么了？\n再更大声喊出来啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d1e1079d647135a0beea0c562ffbb2737e4b94129cd78fe963d879de4c655ff",
      "text": "演出结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:badf37c1a8242a658cd251a564a3715a9018f524d80362c047993977e644bfb8",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n现场的一体感太厉害了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fbb21749f880991b14accad6fbbbbf80cb2d5a585d698db8a86b610e407f4d8",
      "text": "所以我不就说过了嘛？只要我拿出真本事，\n还能让现场更嗨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ca2eee5c267b821f6e0cd1b998e96a8e33184278e22cdc933d248bd82e6178",
      "text": "应该也有不少人成为我们的天使酱和天使君了\n吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14620719e207cd257f46878fa09c1ad31f012a09bcebed9b21ef0a902fc75cfa",
      "text": "喂，你们几个别太得意忘形了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d321e933897c3534828937dbb2d000f182fa0ffbbf2309468ad7e3aba3bfce69",
      "text": "你这家伙，又来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb5be0660bead4cf1fe1a688ffe092b8adffdf115069048a93ccd21da335665",
      "text": "偶像不过是嘻嘻哈哈傻笑，\n自己既不会写曲也不会填词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc20e584cb2f9af9a32acd3235e70147b4a7ff0d97790e4b9e5833f8f0deeca4",
      "text": "不就是一群什么都不会的丢人家伙嘛！\n啊哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e7e1c83bc54f47127a943dbe47d214334f363bfe9709470e7054c0c7ff4df3",
      "text": "你眼里看不到观众吗？什么都做不到的\n家伙，怎么可能把气氛调动到那种地步啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ec86f7a8ef59edd7e3ddc5ec21858ee92e31e51082d20f763bd62cc4f5c03a",
      "text": "我们虽然不是乐队，\n但作为偶像，已经把技术磨砺到了极致。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba459a177e95aa2b3d7b815682fcf432bb8b4061babebfc559dfd08c63f97d8",
      "text": "这份力量是我们的骄傲，\n没有哪怕一丁点的难为情哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3583a113e1b6cbba131b1cec1d098afd9b9f4196d99f71a2b7cf6c4464232ce5",
      "text": "什……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab5c4651e2f1fb0811120b8e6e89a16b28dfa85f6ee564e12a4303e034c39bf3",
      "text": "我们可还有一次出场机会呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:642135f921a581e12b3012a900bc7bc9057047c9655acb9c6f258096336274e2",
      "text": "大哥哥们瞧不起的偶像之力，\n就好好期待着吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c0a9e4d6aaebeebb0f656ecbec303b592d79826c63dba1c4be902457e33fa0",
      "text": "你、你们既然说到这个份上，我就看看你们有几斤几两。\n待会儿可别哭丧着脸啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f0f0eb6e568d69c5903b1bfbaf1cb1a7dd03b53dcbebd3647c22091b18df4c",
      "text": "再次祝贺，摇滚音乐节辛苦了！\n取得了巨大的成功呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2904970a3af83c5f3ad718853600064ae5937d8da2d8a37422b1d0e8a50f120f",
      "text": "噢！听说成了大热门的话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c76d1a19cf12c19286efc741c948f10fec9ae6bdb06b09b2a2ebbf44203a2ca",
      "text": "冬马先生认识的那位朋友，听说也能够\n再次在Livehouse办演出了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5e598209bdd9ec489fa9a1a1ad6ce95b0f055c6deb39f2f01a4296ec4a6d9a",
      "text": "这样啊……\n嘿嘿，能帮上忙太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8afab67278353f330ae444dced17d61b986831db545ceeae85b42a8daf343e7",
      "text": "咳咳……呜——喉咙好痛哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:170209a876189b487ebce2d4321b00da36ed04454dca2219cf51d9fb9eee60ad",
      "text": "我的手臂也有点痛呢……\n太拼命了，变成肌肉酸痛了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c183367fafd63f3cec5568babbb25dbadfd347053e5be44b27dd5ab56c045aa0",
      "text": "搞什么啊你们两个。\n明明是让人高兴的汇报，怎么在这抱怨啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216820318455322b8c41625b04b0f89ead5db3cb73813cdff4c3d8aa6d64ab4d",
      "text": "呵呵，不是那样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53777552b4efd24096c002208a6ab1ea4bb899b0fc1dd06972f17616064abcfa",
      "text": "我们只是因为当时太尽兴了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1a48dbd826dc6394b85b0299b233c28a9637e93721ad56e4fc168bfb51e871f",
      "text": "想说跟着冬马一路走来真是太好了而已哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
